    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="73">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 73</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{CXVII} Gif hit bið niht eald þiefð, gebeten þa þone gylt þe hine gefengon swa hie geþingian mægan wið cyning ⁊ his gerefan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If the theft is a night old, then let those who caught him [and allowed him to escape] pay whatever debt [for their carelessness] that they may arrange with the king and his reeve.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If a night has elapsed since the thefts, those who caught him [and allowed him to escape] shall make compensation for their offence, according to such terms as they can arrange with the king and his reeve.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif hit bið nyht eald þyfð, gebeten þa ðone gylt þe hine gefengon, swa hy geþingian mægon wiþ cyning ⁊ his gerefan.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
